--- /home/rossierd/edgemtech/products/edgem1/edgem1/30/build/tmp/work/linux-6.6-verdin-r0/linux-6.6-verdin/drivers/media/i2c/Kconfig	2026-04-08 18:20:07.678600353 +0200
